WEBVTT

00:02:28.394 --> 00:02:30.354
The machine age.

00:02:30.354 --> 00:02:34.400
It's when we first hear the buzzwords
of the modern moment.

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:37.361
Disruption, acceleration.

00:02:37.361 --> 00:02:39.113
That's Karl Marx, actually.

00:02:40.114 --> 00:02:42.325
Acceleration of production,

00:02:42.325 --> 00:02:46.245
the factory system,
acceleration of transport,

00:02:46.287 --> 00:02:47.955
the coming of the railways.

00:02:47.997 --> 00:02:50.625
No need for ships to wait for the wind.

00:02:50.666 --> 00:02:53.419
Coal-fired, steam-powered.

00:02:53.461 --> 00:02:55.796
Acceleration of information.

00:02:57.006 --> 00:02:59.258
The global village.

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:02.428
And it's when we start
digging fossil fuels out of the ground